{"text":"kuruntokai","n":62,"lines":["கோடல் எதிர்முகைப் பசுவீ முல்லை","நாறிதழ்க் குவளையொ டிடையிடுபு விரைஇ","ஐதுதொடை மாண்ட கோதை போல","நறிய நல்லோள் மேனி","முறியினும் வாய்வது முயங்கற்கும் இனிதே"],"tr":["kōṭal etirmukaip pacuvī mullai","nāṟitaḻk kuvaḷaiyo ṭiṭaiyiṭupu viraii","aitutoṭai māṇṭa kōtai pōla","naṟiya nallōḷ mēṉi","muṟiyiṉum vāyvatu muyaṅkaṟkum iṉitē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"kuṟiñci","tinai_ta":"குறிஞ்சி","speaker_ta":"தலைவன் கூற்று","poet_ta":"சிறைக்குடி ஆந்தையார்","speaker_en":"the hero (talaivaṉ)","poet_tr":"Ciṟaikkuṭi Āntaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 15, veṇcīr 4"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 10, veṇṭaḷai 5, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கோடல்","tr":"kōṭal","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டல்","tr":"ṭal"}]},{"text":"எதிர்முகைப்","tr":"etirmukaip","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"எதிர்","tr":"etir"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"முகைப்","tr":"mukaip"}]},{"text":"பசுவீ","tr":"pacuvī","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பசு","tr":"pacu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வீ","tr":"vī"}]},{"text":"முல்லை","tr":"mullai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முல்","tr":"mul"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]}],[{"text":"நாறிதழ்க்","tr":"nāṟitaḻk","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நா","tr":"nā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றிதழ்க்","tr":"ṟitaḻk"}]},{"text":"குவளையொ","tr":"kuvaḷaiyo","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"குவ","tr":"kuva"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளை","tr":"ḷai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யொ","tr":"yo"}]},{"text":"டிடையிடுபு","tr":"ṭiṭaiyiṭupu","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிடை","tr":"ṭiṭai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிடு","tr":"yiṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பு","tr":"pu"}]},{"text":"விரைஇ","tr":"viraii","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"விரை","tr":"virai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"இ","tr":"i"}]}],[{"text":"ஐதுதொடை","tr":"aitutoṭai","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"ஐ","tr":"ai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"துதொ","tr":"tuto"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டை","tr":"ṭai"}]},{"text":"மாண்ட","tr":"māṇṭa","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மாண்","tr":"māṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ட","tr":"ṭa"}]},{"text":"கோதை","tr":"kōtai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கோ","tr":"kō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தை","tr":"tai"}]},{"text":"போல","tr":"pōla","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"போ","tr":"pō"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ல","tr":"la"}]}],[{"text":"நறிய","tr":"naṟiya","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நறி","tr":"naṟi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ய","tr":"ya"}]},{"text":"நல்லோள்","tr":"nallōḷ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லோள்","tr":"lōḷ"}]},{"text":"மேனி","tr":"mēṉi","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மே","tr":"mē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னி","tr":"ṉi"}]}],[{"text":"முறியினும்","tr":"muṟiyiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முறி","tr":"muṟi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யினும்","tr":"yiṉum"}]},{"text":"வாய்வது","tr":"vāyvatu","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வாய்","tr":"vāy"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வது","tr":"vatu"}]},{"text":"முயங்கற்கும்","tr":"muyaṅkaṟkum","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முயங்","tr":"muyaṅ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கற்","tr":"kaṟ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கும்","tr":"kum"}]},{"text":"இனிதே","tr":"iṉitē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இனி","tr":"iṉi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கோடல்","parts":[{"text":"கோடல்","lemma":"கோடல்","gloss":"white glory lily"}],"gloss":"white glory lily"},{"surface":"எதிர்முகை","parts":[{"text":"எதிர்","lemma":"எதிர்","gloss":"opening"},{"text":"முகை","lemma":"முகை","gloss":"bud"}],"gloss":"opening bud"},{"surface":"பசுவீ","parts":[{"text":"பசு","lemma":"பசு","gloss":"fresh"},{"text":"வீ","lemma":"வீ","gloss":"flower"}],"gloss":"fresh flower"},{"surface":"முல்லை","parts":[{"text":"முல்லை","lemma":"முல்லை","gloss":"jasmine"}],"gloss":"jasmine"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாறிதழ்","parts":[{"text":"நாறு","lemma":"நாறு","gloss":"fragrant"},{"text":"இதழ்","lemma":"இதழ்","gloss":"petal"}],"gloss":"fragrant petal"},{"surface":"குவளையொடு","parts":[{"text":"குவளை","lemma":"குவளை","gloss":"blue water lily"},{"text":"ஒடு","lemma":"ஒடு","gloss":"with"}],"gloss":"with blue water lily"},{"surface":"இடையிடுபு","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"middle"},{"text":"இடுபு","lemma":"இடு","gloss":"placing"}],"gloss":"interspersing"},{"surface":"விரைஇ","parts":[{"text":"விரைஇ","lemma":"விரை","gloss":"having mixed"}],"gloss":"having mixed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"ஐதுதொடை","parts":[{"text":"ஐது","lemma":"ஐது","gloss":"delicate"},{"text":"தொடை","lemma":"தொடை","gloss":"stringing"}],"gloss":"delicate stringing"},{"surface":"மாண்ட","parts":[{"text":"மாண்ட","lemma":"மாண்","gloss":"excellent"}],"gloss":"excellent"},{"surface":"கோதை","parts":[{"text":"கோதை","lemma":"கோதை","gloss":"garland"}],"gloss":"garland"},{"surface":"போல","parts":[{"text":"போல","lemma":"போல்","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நறிய","parts":[{"text":"நறிய","lemma":"நறிது","gloss":"fragrant"}],"gloss":"fragrant"},{"surface":"நல்லோள்","parts":[{"text":"நல்","lemma":"நல்","gloss":"good"},{"text":"ஓள்","lemma":"அவள்","gloss":"woman"}],"gloss":"good woman"},{"surface":"மேனி","parts":[{"text":"மேனி","lemma":"மேனி","gloss":"body"}],"gloss":"body"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"முறியினும்","parts":[{"text":"முறி","lemma":"முறி","gloss":"tender shoot"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"than"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even than a tender shoot"},{"surface":"வாய்வது","parts":[{"text":"வாய்வது","lemma":"வாய்","gloss":"being soft"}],"gloss":"is softer"},{"surface":"முயங்கற்கும்","parts":[{"text":"முயங்கல்","lemma":"முயங்கு","gloss":"embracing"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"also"}],"gloss":"even to embrace"},{"surface":"இனிதே","parts":[{"text":"இனிது","lemma":"இனிது","gloss":"sweet"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is sweet indeed"}]}],"literal":"White glory lily's opening buds, fresh-flowered jasmine, / with fragrant-petaled blue water lily, interspersed and mixed, / like a garland of excellent delicate stringing, / the fragrant good woman's body / is softer than a tender shoot, and is sweet indeed to embrace.","translation":"Like a beautifully strung garland, where the opening buds of the white glory lily and fresh jasmines are interspersed and woven together with fragrant-petaled blue water lilies, the fragrant body of my good woman is softer than a tender sprout, and is so sweet to embrace.","modern":"வெண்காந்தளின் விரியும் மொட்டுகளும், புதிய முல்லைப் பூக்களும், நறுமணமுள்ள இதழ்களைக் கொண்ட குவளைப் பூக்களோடு இடையிடையே கலந்து, நுட்பமாகத் தொடுக்கப்பட்ட மாண்புடைய மாலை போல, நறிய நல்லவளின் மேனி தளிர் இலையை விட மென்மையானது; தழுவுவதற்கும் மிகவும் இனியது.","explanation":"The hero speaks to himself in delight after embracing his beloved, praising her exquisite beauty and softness. He compares her fragrant body to a finely crafted garland woven with opening buds of white glory lily, fresh jasmine, and fragrant blue water lilies. These flowers belong to the Kuriñci landscape, symbolizing the lushness and natural beauty of their mountain home. He declares that her skin is even softer than a tender green shoot and is incredibly sweet to embrace. The key words are 'கோதை போல' (like a garland) and 'முயங்கற்கும் இனிதே' (sweet to embrace).","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}